msgid "admin.general.apps_chat"
msgstr "Chat"

msgid "admin.general.apps_chat_explain"
msgstr "The chat application allows your users to start a real-time chat with your agents. When enabled, a small \"Start Chat\" button will be added to the bottom of every page on the portal, and you can easily add a widget to your own website too."

