msgid "admin.general.apps_downloads"
msgstr "Downloads"

msgid "admin.general.apps_downloads_explain"
msgstr "The downloads applications allows your agents to upload files into a structured downloads section that users can search and browse from your portal."

msgid "admin.general.apps_feedback"
msgstr "Feedback"

msgid "admin.general.apps_feedback_explain"
msgstr "The feedback application allows users to submit suggestions or feedback, and browse, vote and comment on other users suggestions. This can give you valuable insight into common requests or problems from the perspective of your customers."

msgid "admin.general.apps_kb"
msgstr "Knowledgebase"

msgid "admin.general.apps_kb_explain"
msgstr "The knowledgebase application allows your agents to write help articles that users can search and browse from your portal."

msgid "admin.general.apps_news"
msgstr "News"

msgid "admin.general.apps_news_explain"
msgstr "The news application adds a news feed to the home page of your portal. This is usually used as a blog or news feed."

msgid "admin.general.apps_tasks"
msgstr "Agent Tasks"

msgid "admin.general.apps_tasks_explain"
msgstr "The tasks application is used by agents to manage lists of todo items. Tasks can be created and set due dates, and assigned to specific agents or teams."

msgid "admin.general.apps_tickets"
msgstr "Tickets"

msgid "admin.general.apps_tickets_explain"
msgstr "User submit tickets from your website, portal or email. Tickets are the core of DeskPRO and cannot be disabled."

